OL,5,MPOLL TAX HAD ITS PROBLEMS - HESELTINE
OL,7, 109FCollection could have been better
OL,8, 110FLamont denies U-turn on Thatcherism
OL,9, 108FTories "incompetent" over poll tax
OL,11, 114 S AFRICAF12 die in police-ANC clash
OL,13, 105 IRAQFfrees more Kuwaiti detainees
OL,14, 103FTroops ready to quell civil unrest
OL,15, 104FLabour calls for aid for civilians
OL,17, 112 MALIFdeath toll "rises to over 80"
OL,19, 113 POLICEFinvestigate London Marathon
