OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGS AFRICA: 12 DEAD AFTER
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGCLASHES WITH POLICE
OL,4,D
OL,5, Eleven ANC supporters and one police
OL,6, officer are reported to have died in
OL,7, violent clashes in South AfrUca.
OL,9,FLocal residents say police surrounded
OL,10,Fthe meeting in Daveyton, Johannesburg
OL,11,Fand opened fire without warning.
OL,13,FThe police say they were attacked by
OL,14,FANC supporters wielding knives and axes
OL,15,F- mortally wounding a police sergeant.
OL,17,FThe African National Congress says
OL,18,Fpeople at the meeting fought back after
OL,19,Fthey were attacked by the police.
OL,21,FSome 30 people were also injured.
OL,23,D]FFromG24-03-91F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
