OL,1,Vk4                               G9/13
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGOVER 1,000 KUWAITI
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGDETAINEES HEAD HOME
OL,4,D
OL,5, Another 1,159 Kuwaitis who had been
OL,6, held by Iraq during the Gulf war are
OL,7, on their way home.
OL,9,FThey were handed over to the
OL,10,FInternational Committee of the Red
OL,11,FCross earlier today and are now in
OL,12,FSaudi Arabia.
OL,14,FThey are expected to complete their
OL,15,Fjourney to Kuwait by plane tomorrow.
OL,16,FAnother 450 Kuwaitis arrived back in
OL,17,FKuwait earlier today.
OL,19,FThe ICRC has also announced that 1,000
OL,20,FIraqi prisoners of war were repatriated
OL,21,Fto their home country today.
OL,23,D]FFromG24-03-91F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
