OL,1,Vk4                              G10/13
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGIRAQ DISMISSES DRAFT
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGUN RESOLUTION
OL,4,F
OL,5, Iraq has attacked the United States
OL,6, over its latest plans at the UN for a
OL,7, permanent Gulf ceasefire.
OL,9,FThe official Iraqi news agency said
OL,10,FAmerica wanted to rob Iraq of its
OL,11,Fsovereignty and mortgage its resources.
OL,13,FThe UN resolution says agreement must
OL,14,Fbe reached on the precise border
OL,15,Fbetween Iraq and Kuwait, and on war
OL,16,Freparations from Iraq, before the trade
OL,17,Fembargo is lifted.
OL,18,F
OL,19,FIt also sets a four-month timetable for
OL,20,Fthe Iraqis to destroy all their
OL,21,Fballistic missiles.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG24-03-91F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
