OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1774358952
OL,1,Vk4                              G11/13
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGSADDAM PREPARES TO
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGATTACK KURDS
OL,5, Iraqi rebels say President Saddam
OL,6, Hussein is preparing to attempt to
OL,7, regain control of northern Iraq.
OL,9,FThe Kurdish rebels said large numbers
OL,10,Fof government troops and equipment were
OL,11,Fbeing moved to the north.
OL,13,FThey reported seeing between 2,000 and
OL,14,F4,000 troops supported by 80 tanks in a
OL,15,Fregion 100 miles north of Baghdad, and
OL,16,F12 missiles which were ready for firing
OL,18,FIraqi refugees arriving in Iran have
OL,19,Freported that thousands of Iraqi
OL,20,Fsoldiers and Republican Guard troops
OL,21,Fare defecting, with their weapons.
OL,22,                           F
OL,23,D]FFromG24-03-91F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
