PN,49612
SC,0012
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1774358952
OL,1,Vk4                              G12/13
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGDEATH TOLL RISES AMONG
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGMALI PROTESTORS
OL,5, At least three more people have died in
OL,6, clashes between troops and protesters
OL,7, in the west African state of Mali.
OL,8,F
OL,9,FOpposition leaders have said troops
OL,10,Ffiring on pro-democracy crowds killed
OL,11,Fover 80 people since the protests began
OL,12,Fon Friday. Officials say 34 have died.
OL,14,FAn opposition rally has today called on
OL,15,Fthe government of President Moussa
OL,16,FTraore to resign and demanded an end to
OL,17,Fone party rule.
OL,18,F
OL,19,FA BBC correspondent says criminal
OL,20,Felements have taken to the streets of
OL,21,Fthe capital, Bamako.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG24-03-91F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
