OL,1,Vk4                              G13/13
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGPOLICE LAUNCH PROBE INTO
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGLONDON MARATHON
OL,4,D
OL,5, Scotland Yard has confirmed that fraud
OL,6, squad officers are investigating
OL,7, allegations about the London Marathon.
OL,9,FIt follows reports about the financial
OL,10,Faffairs of the event, which is run by
OL,11,Fformer Olympic athlete Christopher
OL,12,FBrasher and businessman John Disley.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FChannel Four's Dispatches programme
OL,15,Flast week made allegations about the
OL,16,Fdestination of proceeds from the event.
OL,18,FMr Brasher said: "There's no fraud or
OL,19,Ffalse accountancy. We have absolutely
OL,20,Fnothing to hide."
OL,22,D]F This Ceefax page is fromG24-03-91
